en (search_algo =\nObservableSurfMapOrgan, Wrapper -\u003e paper_source) -- war das EINZIGE PaperBinding mit rohem Wrapper; jetzt\nkonsistent mit ART/HOT/START/Wormhole + nicht vom Flip umgeroutet.\n\nNicht-Pool (store-traversierbar/Default-Flach) + alle 11 References: BIT-IDENTISCH (kein M3-Pin-Effekt).\nCodex 3 Runden (2 FIX behoben: seg-T0-lookup-Routing + tier_clear-reset + SurfPaperBinding) -\u003e SHIP-WITH-NITS.\nLIMIT (B, 4b-c/D): Segment-Timer-Key-Ernte fuer Pools degeneriert auf {0} (search_organ_ leer; natives Organ\nhat noch kein save_state/key-iteration) -\u003e per-op-seg_ns-Degeneration, KEIN Observer-T0-/Korrektheitsfehler.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) \u003cnoreply@anthropic.com\u003e\n","author_name":"Benjamin-Elias Probst","author_email":"benjamineliasprobst@gmail.com","authored_date":"2026-07-01T18:53:07.000+02:00","committer_name":"Benjamin-Elias Probst","committer_email":"benjamineliasprobst@gmail.com","committed_date":"2026-07-01T18:53:07.000+02:00","trailers":{},"extended_trailers":{},"web_url":"https://gitlab.comdare.de/comdare/research/comdare-cache-engine/-/commit/cd25b9b3b4490ac66cff04ce5b7ea705c63531fb"},"pipeline":{"id":7362,"iid":237,"project_id":286,"sha":"cd25b9b3b4490ac66cff04ce5b7ea705c63531fb","ref":"main","status":"success","source":"push","created_at":"2026-07-01T16:53:37.567Z","updated_at":"2026-07-01T17:14:27.046Z","web_url":"https://gitlab.comdare.de/comdare/research/comdare-cache-engine/-/pipelines/7362"},"web_url":"https://gitlab.comdare.de/comdare/research/comdare-cache-engine/-/jobs/191740","project":{"ci_job_token_scope_enabled":false},"artifacts":[],"runner":{"id":16,"description":"prod-baremetal-prod1","ip_address":null,"active":true,"paused":false,"is_shared":true,"runner_type":"instance_type","name":null,"online":true,"created_by":{"id":1,"username":"root","public_email":null,"name":"Administrator","state":"active","locked":false,"avatar_url":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/cda9ed339d5b94a8b88b